   "bodyText": "Catch a glimpse of the colorful reef life in the world famous Ofu Lagoon. The Ofu island unit has a shallow protected reef with a great diversity of coral cover and fish. This is a feast for the eyes in the morning light. Keep an eye out for octopus and sea turtles. Be aware of the location of rip current (avas) wherever you swim. <br /> <br /> Note: There are no gear rentals available. Bring your own gear.",
